description:
One-time secret from an envelope you already encrypted locally: {"v":1,"alg":"A256GCM","iv":...,"ct":...}
(unpadded base64url; never send plaintext or keys here). create returns reveal_token and receipt_token;
status/revoke take receipt_token. Revealing happens in a browser at /s/<id>#<key>.<reveal_token>, or by POST
/v1/secrets/<id>/reveal. People can also use the browser tool at https://setget.net/s.
